sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as AuthController
    participant B as Browser (Next.js web)
    participant PG as PermissionGuard
    participant AC as AcademicScopeService
    participant M as Feature Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    PG->>DB: grantKeysForMembership (permissions DB-fresh, never from JWT)
    DB-->>PG: granted keys (manage implies action)
    PG->>AC: resolveScope(membershipId)
    AC-->>PG: whole-institute (admin) or subject-set
    C->>M: service call scoped by tenant.instituteId
    M->>DB: queries filtered by institute_id + academic scope predicate
    DB-->>M: rows (tenant + scope scoped)
    M-->>C: response
    C-->>B: 200 JSON